#
# Anchored with a leading slash, all of them. An unanchored "build/" matches a
# directory of that name at any depth, which quietly swallowed
# packaging/build/Mopper.Native.targets -- git add said nothing, and the gap only
# showed up as a missing file on the runner. Every entry here names one directory
# at the top of the repository, so every entry says so.
#
/build/

